# Caretaker's Talent: a copy of a permanent spell becomes a token as it resolves (CR 707.10f, 111.13); it enters under its
# caster's control, so it is "a token you control" for the Talent's controller only when he cast it. In turn 2 Bot2's
# Uldaros Theorix casts a copy of its sacrificed Black Lotus: a Black Lotus token enters under Bot2 and Bot1 draws
# nothing (hand: 2 after turn 1, 3 with the turn-3 draw). In turn 3 Bot1's own Uldaros Theorix does the same and the
# Lotus token that enters under Bot1 draws a card: Lotus 2, Uldaros 1, Talent's card 2.

